      "250:value": "{\n  \"subject_definitions\": [\n    \"<Subject 1> is the young woman from <Picture 1>, with a pale complexion, long black hair arranged in an elaborate updo with side-falling strands, blue floral hair ornaments and delicate dangling chains, refined eye makeup, red lips, gold-and-blue earrings, layered necklaces, and an ornate blue-and-gold fitted bodice beneath translucent pale-blue wide sleeves and a long flowing skirt.\",\n    \"<Subject 2> is the young man from <Picture 2>, with a pale complexion, long black hair tied high with a dark hair ornament, loose strands framing his face, straight brows, a calm serious expression, and layered black traditional robes with gray embroidered trim, wide sleeves, a waist belt with hanging metal ornaments, and dark wrist-covering fabric.\",\n    \"<Subject 3> is the woman from <Picture 3>, serving as the senior martial sister, with a fair complexion, long black hair half tied into an updo with red floral hair ornaments and dangling beads, soft natural makeup, pearl-like earrings, a red embroidered collar, layered crimson robes with wide sleeves, a dark decorated waist sash, and long trailing red fabric ribbons.\",\n    \"<Subject 4> is the snow-forest environment from <Picture 4>, with a large dark-barked tree on the left, snow-covered branches densely filled with vivid red plum blossoms, a pale blue-white forest receding into mist, an uneven snowy ground, and continuously falling snow.\"\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"[reference generation] A 5-second 2-shot cinematic sequence in a snowy plum forest featuring a wide establishing shot of <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> arriving, followed by a tight facial close-up of <Subject 3> turning around to speak.\",\n  \"retention_analysis\": [\n    \"<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the elaborate updo, blue floral hair ornaments, translucent pale-blue wide sleeves, and flowing blue dress are retained.\",\n    \"<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the long black hair, layered black traditional robes, dark wrist coverings, and solemn expression are retained.\",\n    \"<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the fair facial features, red floral ornaments, delicate makeup, and crimson embroidered collar are retained.\",\n    \"<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the snowy red-plum forest, cool mist, and continuously falling snowflakes remain consistent.\"\n  ],\n  \"detailed_description\": \"Cinematic high-detail Chinese fantasy drama style, sharp facial focus, soft diffused winter lighting, vibrant contrast between red blossoms, blue robes, black robes, and white snow, 8k photorealistic quality.\\n\\n[Shot 1] Wide establishing shot (00:00.000 - 00:02.500). <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> stand side-by-side in a two-shot long view within the misty snowy landscape of <Subject 4>. <Subject 1> in her translucent pale-blue robes and <Subject 2> in his dark black robes walk carefully through ankle-deep snow toward the distant blooming red plum trees, their hair and robe ribbons moving gently in the winter wind.\\n\\n[Shot 2] Extreme close-up tracking shot (00:02.500 - 00:05.000). At 00:02.500, cut to an intense facial close-up of <Subject 3> under the red plum branches of <Subject 4>. Her delicate face fills the frame as she turns around towards the camera, snow particles settling on her black hair and red floral ornaments. With a soft and practical expression, <Subject 3> (S1) speaks directly to them, <d>[Chinese] 你们来了，群主刚睡下，我正准备给群主做饭去。</d> The camera holds tightly on her subtle eye micro-expressions before cutting to black.\",\n  \"overall_soundscape\": \"Continuous soft snowfall, light wintry wind passing through branches, muted footsteps compressing snow, robe rustling, and clear gentle female voice reverberating in the open forest.\",\n  \"non_diegetic_music\": \"N/A\"\n}",
